# Engineering governance — the handbook defines the AI workflow rules (including
# the auto-merge carve-outs) and the decision log records the decisions the
# autopilot enforces. These must NOT be auto-mergeable under the very rules they
# set: a human MUST review a change to them. CODEOWNERS itself is included so the
# owner set can't be edited without human review. (DR-2026-07-16, review of #1761.)
